# A whitelist: the image gets requirements.txt and dashboard/, nothing else.
# A local `docker build` sees gitignored files too (data/*.db, recon/, .env);
# listing what goes in keeps them out without naming each one.
*
!requirements.txt
!dashboard

# Inside dashboard/: the public DB ships for readers of the repo, and the app
# never opens it (the uncompressed copy exists only locally).
dashboard/assets/signal_pulse_public.db.gz
dashboard/assets/signal_pulse_public.db
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
